===Pokémon Adventures===
A female Preschooler was one of the {{pkmn|Trainer}}s that received a Prop Case and tried on a Smiley-Face Mask on her {{p|Elgyem}} in ''[[PS483|Special Delivery]]''.

In ''[[PS486|Unraveling Mysteries]]'', a male Preschooler was seen marveling at a {{p|Patrat}} balloon that a {{tc|Harlequin}} made.

In ''[[PS553|Sylveon Enchants]]'', a female Preschooler was briefly seen at the Mini-game Corner with her {{p|Pancham}}.

In ''[[PS558|What Does Charmander Do When It Dozes]]'', a male Preschooler was briefly seen playing in the streets of [[Lumiose City]] with his Litleo.

A male Preschooler appeared in ''[[PS560|Trevenant Pokes]]'' with his older brother, a {{tc|Youngster}}, at the [[Tower of Mastery]] before deciding to go home.

In ''[[PASM15|Shipwreck and "Oh, What Sharp Teeth You Have, Bruxish!"]]'', two Preschoolers were seen at the [[Aether House]] playing with a {{p|Yungoos}}.
