==Trivia==
* Preschooler's [[prize money|base payout]] in {{game|Black and White|s}} and its sequels is {{PDollar}}4, the lowest of all Trainers.
* While present within the game data, the Preschooler Trainer class goes unused in [[Pokémon Sword and Shield]].
* In Festival Plaza, the phrase "I like male/female Preschoolers!" was changed to "I like '''battling''' male/female Preschoolers!" in {{pkmn|Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon|Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon}}. This is the only Trainer class to be changed this way.

